# Per-repo settings for the preview-deploy skill, sourced by preview.sh.
# No Coolify application exists for Bookplate at the moment (the "Bookplate (QA)"
# app was taken down on 2026-11-18; production is the Home Assistant add-on).
# To use previews again, create the app (Dockerfile build pack, port 3000,
# preview URL template book-pr-{{pr_id}}.korzun.com, SEED_DEMO=1 with a
# SEED_PASSWORD) and put its UUID here; preview.sh refuses to run while it is empty.
COOLIFY_APP_UUID=
HEALTH_PATH=/api/health
# Space-separated routes to screenshot first; add the ones a change touches.
ROUTES="/login /"
